<title>DENMARK: Rieber raises Phoenix bid.</title>
<headline>Rieber raises Phoenix bid.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Rieber and Son on Friday said it raised its bid for Danish roadbuilder Phoenix Contractors to 875.8 million crowns, matching a rival offer by Denmark's Icopal.</p>
</text>
